                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72119/9004: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner in Hungary</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Grant-Smith</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Budapest</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-02-09T10:00:00+01:00">February 9, 1920—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received via Paris February 10—12:45
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>General Bandholtz and staff left Budapest this morning on the direct special
                    train bearing the Hungarian peace delegation to Paris.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Grant-Smith</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
